OL,3,GNEWSAPolice urge farming communities to
OL,4,Areport rural crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FVictims of rural crime have been urged
OL,7,Fto report incidents as a fifth base for
OL,8,Fspecialist police officers opens.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police (TVP) launched its
OL,11,FRural Crime Taskforce in March 2022 and
OL,12,F26 staff are based at offices in
OL,13,FBanbury, Buckingham, Abingdon and
OL,14,FNewbury. A fifth opened with five staff
OL,15,Fin Maidenhead earlier.
OL,17,FOne farmer from Berkshire said he has
OL,18,Ffortified his site to make it more
OL,19,Fdifficult for criminals to steal or
OL,20,Fsmash up equipment, which he said
OL,21,Fhappens routinely.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
