OL,3,GNEWSAPolice urge farming communities to
OL,4,Areport rural crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FInsp Chris Ball, who leads the
OL,7,Ftaskforce, said rural crime has dropped
OL,8,Fby about 10% over the past year, part
OL,9,Fof a "quite significant" drop over
OL,10,Frecent years.
